    ↓
runValidator("slack", payload)     ← catches errors BEFORE API call
    ↓ (if valid)
POST /v2/notify
    ↓ (if 400)
parseApiValidationErrors(response) ← maps API errors to same shape
    ↓
Show errors in UI
